.inc CoilcraftTemplates.lib

*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : TA7849
* Inductance = 39nH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 1MHz-3GHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor RF Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt TA7849 port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=0.17pF Ind=39nH
X1 port1 port2 Model2A PARAMS:
+ R1=11
+ R2=0.1
+ C= {Cpar}
+ K1=0.00004
+ K3= {Ind}
.ends TA7849

